This extension adds Dragon Ball: Sparking! Zero modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "SZModLib" to the "SparkingZERO\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "LFSE" to the "SparkingZERO\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".uplugin" extension to the "SparkingZERO\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file with the ".json" extension to the "SparkingZERO\Mods\ZeroSpark\Json" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with both a "Content" and a "Binaries" folder to the "SparkingZERO" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "LogicMods" folder to the "SparkingZERO\Content\Paks\LogicMods\LogicMods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "'.pak" file to the "SparkingZERO\Content\Paks\~mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a "dwmapi.dll" file to the "SparkingZERO\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".lua" file and a "Scripts" folder to the "SparkingZERO\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a ".dll" file and a "dlls" folder to the "SparkingZERO\Binaries\Win64\ue4ss\Mods" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a top-level folder such as "SparkingZERO" to the game folder itself (no subfolder).[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a config file such as "engine.ini" or "game.ini" to the "LOCALAPPDATA\SparkingZERO\Saved\Config\Windows" folder.[/*]
[*]Save mods are recognised by the Save installer.[/*]
[*]Installs mods with a file or folder named "dsound.dll" and a file or folder named "dbsparkingzeroutocbypass.asi" to the "SparkingZERO\Binaries\Win64" folder.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

